{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果MacBook的靜音鍵本應讓設備安靜下來，但一位開發者卻找到了一種讓靜音的MacBook重新「發聲」的方法。這個聲音並非來自傳統揚聲器，而是直接由觸控板發出：通過高速驅動觸控板內用於模擬按壓反饋的觸覺馬達，把細微的震動轉化為帶有機械感的語音。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587872.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T19:44:25.379342+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:26:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_hash":"904a5ad4661050fe7eaf70c9d382c10cddef6b52f8cbfe65798c7b0bfe45e3bc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}